sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P0 as Reader (Guest / signed-in)
    participant P1 as Web Application (News UI)
    participant P2 as CommentController / GuestCommentIdentity
    participant P3 as InteractionService / CommentModeration
    participant P4 as Application Database
    participant P5 as Moderation API (OpenAI)
    P0->>P1: enter comment or reply
    P1->>P2: POST /news/{id}/comment or /comments/{id}/replies
    P2->>P2: validate content, resolve published parent for replies
    opt [guest reader]
    P2->>P2: validate challenge age 3s–2h, news ID and session
    P2->>P4: find/create guest identity, lock identity, read daily quota
    P4-->>P2: return username and comment_count
    Note over P0,P5: Invalid challenge or quota of 3/day reached: stop with validation error. Guest quota day uses Asia/Jakarta in the implementation.
    end
    P2->>P3: addComment(...) / addReply(...)
    P3->>P4: verify active news, check duplicate submission_hash
    P4-->>P3: return eligibility and duplicate result
    Note over P0,P5: Duplicate content stops with validation error. Replies must reference a published parent.
    P3->>P3: check(content): detect suspicious links / promotion
    alt [moderation API key configured]
    P3->>P5: POST /v1/moderations (omni-moderation-latest, content)
    P5-->>P3: return flags / categories, or error
    else [no moderation key]
    P3->>P3: use pending_review fallback
    end
    P3->>P3: choose published only if clean, valid and not suspicious
    Note over P0,P5: Flagged, suspicious, unavailable or malformed results remain pending_review. The Laravel moderation service calls this API directly, it does not call the project AI service.
    P3->>P4: transaction: lock news, recheck duplicate, insert comment
    P3->>P4: insert initial comment_moderation_history
    P4-->>P3: return saved comment
    P3-->>P2: return status
    opt [guest submission succeeded]
    P2->>P4: increment guest_comment_days, commit guest transaction
    end
    P2-->>P1: 201: status, remaining_quota and confirmation
    P1-->>P0: show published or awaiting-review confirmation
    Note over P0,P5: Short-video comments use ShortCommentService with short_video_comments / short_video_comment_history and the shared moderation and guest-identity services.
